  "description": "Shared reliable-UDP transport layer for DS_Communication — no third-party types appear in the public API. Provides RudpSession, RudpMessageChannel with per-message RudpSendOptions/RudpDeliveryMethod (unreliable, reliable, reliable-ordered), and RudpTransportOptions with optional DTLS 1.2 encryption (BouncyCastle) and CRC32C integrity checking. One dedicated polling thread per host plus per-session dispatch queues keep load independent of connection count. Targets .NET Standard 2.1 — runs on modern .NET and Unity.",
